      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay so i do have a dedicated room for my design work, i don't use it for anything else. but i'm worried about the audit side of things. like, if the amount is pretty high, what kind of documentation do i actually need to keep to prove to the irs that it was strictly for work and not just a piece of furniture for my living room?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
